<title>RUSSIA: Russia 6-mth T-bill auction yields avg 74.34 pct.</title>
<headline>Russia 6-mth T-bill auction yields avg 74.34 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>An issue of seven trillion roubles of six-month GKO discount Treasury bills yielded an average 74.34 percent at auction, the Russian central bank said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>At the previous auction of six-month T-bills on August 21, the average yield was 74.16 percent.</p>
</text>
